# Derived Monte-Carlo ensembles cached by the physics tests (research/code/tests/ensemble_cache.py).
# Regenerated on demand; the cache key fingerprints lattice_generator.py, so it cannot go stale.
.ensemble-cache/

# Machine-local configuration: where the lattice ensemble store lives on THIS machine.
# The store is a separate multi-gigabyte data release with its own DOI, not part of this repo.
# Copy research.local.env.example -> research.local.env and set CONFIGS. Never committed: it
# names one machine's filesystem, which is the thing a published research repo must not carry.
research.local.env
staged.json
